ismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"ed66f0cb15425482dfe5343b235821cb100baa98b81b327cd7bf9d763687d08e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.1/chat.md","size_bytes":14905},"commits":{"digest":"2630008224aa8d4ad683a8e69eace1615f08067b3d522f31e6f362fe7e6dac87","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.1/commits.json","size_bytes":221},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"bd46163388c258cfaf932428ad568ea8986cad7c67906718f7e9f620d82145f2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.1/meta.json","size_bytes":7367},"prompt":{"digest":"dfb6970814ca5702a9d19dec45176281e68de2fef1890c596b5125f7bfde85e5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":184},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"6aab43aa06619c86e2aa76758f42e32bd292a4c6101e78fe07e02c031046476b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":17800},"state":{"digest":"e59d2b7407622abf1274a3e810ae819c92c417ba5a199518a69fe3c7811872d2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.1/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-04T21:00:29.533597+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.1","local_name":"bob-cli-h4.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-h4","agent_clan_generation":"20261104150012","bead_id":"bob-cli-h4.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-h4[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Transfer previews — see every `>` move and merge before it lands[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]When Bryan types a `>` transfer line (`@a+x @b+y > @c…`) in Bob Mac[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Capture, the preview reads like the draft: the tasks he named, an [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]arrow, and where they go. Every source shows its real title and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]fate, the destination shows its real title and container, and every[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]ripple (dependents, warnings, today's links, offers, repairs) is [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]one plain sentence that bob wrote. Below that, landing cards show [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the exact bytes bob will write to the target, the tombstones, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]moved tasks. While the destination is unfinished the panel stays [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]calm and teaches the four destination forms. A refusal reads as a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]refusal, not as red noise. The Mac app still parses nothing: every [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]fact comes from bob's JSON.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]transfer_previews.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/transfer_previews.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-h4[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-h4/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob emits landing blocks for transfers (target, tombstones, [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]moved tasks, sections)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-landing-blocks[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-landing-blocks: make every capture `>` transfer report batch-level [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`task_blocks` with new roles `merge_target`, `merge_source`, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`moved`. Moved blocks carry `moved_from` and a before-image taken from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the source note. Add a batch-level `section_blocks` array for section [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]merges. All JSON is additive.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob enriches merge and move records, serializes merge offers, [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]and fixes their copy[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-transfer-records[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-transfer-records: add status names, target status, container-created[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]flags, and Bob-authored `consequences[]` sentences (titles, not keys) to[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]MergeRecord; add landing line, section, and status to move records; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]serialize merge hand-off offers as item `merge_offers`; give merge-only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]offers their own Pull-In copy; and print titles in the CLI's dependent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob describes an unfinished transfer on dry run[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-transfer-pending[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-transfer-pending: when a dry run fails because a transfer's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]destination is unfinished, attach a read-only `transfer_pending` object [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to the JSON failure. It holds each source resolved to its title and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]status (or Bob's resolution error) and the four destination forms, with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the one being typed marked active.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac transfer card, status line, offers, notifications, and [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]VoiceOver[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-transfer-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-transfer-records[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-transfer-card: replace the monospace transfer bands and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire-word standard header with one designed transfer card that mirrors [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the draft. The card shows the verb, the source rows, an `↓ into` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]connector, the destination, consequence rows, the TODAY badge, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]offer rows. Also rewrite the status line, notification copy, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]VoiceOver summary, regenerate rich recorded fixtures, and add design [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]renders and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac landing cards for target, tombstones, moved tasks, and [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]sections[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-landing-cards[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-landing-blocks, mac-transfer-card[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-landing-cards: render bob's transfer-role task blocks with role [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capsules and a `from inbox.md:5` caption. Fold each tombstone's removed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]runs into one expandable row. Add a section block card, keep bob's block[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]order, and tint the editor's `>` arrow by verb. Add fixtures, design [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]renders, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac calm pending card and transfer refusal card[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-pending-and-refusals[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-transfer-pending, mac-landing-cards[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-pending-and-refusals: never flash red while a transfer destination [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]is unfinished. Run the dry run and render bob's `transfer_pending` as a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]calm card with the resolved sources (typos caught early) and the four [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]destination forms. Render transfer refusals as a designed card with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Bob's message. Add fixtures, design renders, docs, and the manual checks[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list for Bryan.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-h4","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-h4.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-df88251a1f8bcab88109edf7207e9b57","started_at":"2026-11-04T20:01:45.321525+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"d3796399c34235fab50b9cd25fb85d6fa12ed2140db652b54e49b954a546481e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.4--4/chat.md","size_bytes":34901},"commits":{"digest":"63ad60fc854d5a480f2bb30ed0b9dcf07026c504b79a24fa3e455907701fc507","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.4--4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"f2e3f2cec74402091c2ec0c10dd8ffae4836fa08c8d50e33af527c6f18bc72df","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.4--4/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":64},"meta":{"digest":"525d190150dd71a784b1a87d754576c33a6774169df4cafad32b551eb4f7d17d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.4--4/meta.json","size_bytes":661},"prompt":{"digest":"c62c15338509434eb191b77646efac67e378d59594373299279dcb6a067fc942","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.4--4/prompt.md","size_bytes":7047},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"8f227510592890c8df545bdd0d83979fa3af45e51fa80538059872aa807f77ca","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.4--4/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":1720},"state":{"digest":"3f7c1ee33c2da985b205e64b7c996bac7e355a0b2da573256ea08d465519acd5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.4--4/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-04T23:40:48.195911+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-h4.4--4","local_name":"bob-cli-h4.4--4","metadata":{"agent